1. intellij-flix -- Flix language layer (grammar, lexer, parser, PSI, editor)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Origin:   https://github.com/flix/intellij-flix (plugin id org.flixlang.intellij)
Revision: 301699e752da9a675c3caad35836b0599d4671f8
License:  Apache License 2.0

The imported tree snapshot is 375dcc661d95a93d66b262b8365459121913efbb. The
revision above additionally carries the grammar fixes required to pass the
