3. FlixDebugAdapter.java -- DAP<->JDI bridge (REMOVED)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Origin:   https://github.com/wstein/flix-lab (debug-adapter/src)
License:  Apache License 2.0

No longer present. This file was vendored at
backend/src/main/resources/dap/FlixDebugAdapter.java and kept in sync by
scripts/sync-debug-adapter.sh while DAP was the transitional debugging path.
Both were removed once IntelliJ's native JVM debugger passed its gate; see
docs/adr/0002-native-jvm-debugger.md. Nothing derived from it ships in the
built plugin.

Recorded here rather than deleted because the attribution applies to released
versions that did carry it.

